    "html": "<div id=\"Main\"><div class=\"box\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px;\">\n    \n    <div class=\"header\"><div class=\"fr\"><a href=\"/member/mahy50\"><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/5626a240d6b3c1e3c5a12c6601f19c97?s=73&amp;d=retro\" class=\"avatar\" border=\"0\" align=\"default\" alt=\"mahy50\" data-uid=\"172122\"></a></div>\n    <div class=\"flex-one-row gap10\">\n        <div><a href=\"/\">V2EX</a> <span class=\"chevron\">&nbsp;›&nbsp;</span> <a href=\"/go/openai\">OpenAI</a></div>\n        \n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sep10\"></div>\n    <h1>有多少 Plus 用户想要退订 gpt 了？有什么替代方案么？</h1>\n    <div id=\"topic_1254063_votes\" class=\"votes\">\n<a href=\"javascript:\" onclick=\"upVoteTopic(1254063);\" class=\"vote\"><li class=\"fa fa-chevron-up\"></li></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"javascript:\" onclick=\"downVoteTopic(1254063);\" class=\"vote\"><li class=\"fa fa-chevron-down\"></li></a></div> &nbsp; <small class=\"gray\"><a href=\"/member/mahy50\">mahy50</a> · <span title=\"2026-11-03 11:18:18 +08:00\">23 小时 31 分钟前</span> · 7379 次点击</small>\n    </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    <div class=\"cell\">\n        \n        <div class=\"topic_content\">用了几年 gpt 。基本都是工作中开发代码, pro 用不完, plus 不够用（有段时间双持）。<br>1. 感觉 gpt 不断降智, 6 不够用, 6.1sol 需要改几次。<br>2. 额度不断降低, gpt 和 codex 的额度还要合并<br>3. plus5 小时额度卡着很难受。重置和重置卡对 plus 用户意义很小。<br><br>也需等更新了新模型会好点, 但新模型肯定也是消耗巨大。<br><br>订阅了 Grok, 主要是玩 bot, 还没用来开发<br>Claude Code 封号严重, 没实力高成本订阅。<br>问问大家有啥想法？没有更好的方案？</div>\n        \n    </div>\n    \n    \n    <div class=\"cell\">\n        <script async src=\"https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-5060390720525238\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\"></script>\n<ins class=\"adsbygoogle\" style=\"display:block; text-align:center;\" data-ad-layout=\"in-article\" data-ad-format=\"fluid\" data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5060390720525238\" data-ad-slot=\"3793860149\"></ins>\n<script>\n    (adsbygoogle = window.adsbygoogle || []).push({});\n</script>\n    </div>\n    \n    \n    \n</div><div id=\"topic-replies\"><div class=\"box\"><div class=\"cell\"><div class=\"fr\" style=\"margin: -3px -5px 0px 0px;\"><a href=\"/tag/GPT\" class=\"tag\"><li class=\"fa fa-tag\"></li> GPT</a><a href=\"/tag/退订\" class=\"tag\"><li class=\"fa fa-tag\"></li> 退订</a><a href=\"/tag/替代\" class=\"tag\"><li class=\"fa fa-tag\"></li> 替代</a></div><span class=\"gray\">61 条回复 &nbsp;<strong class=\"snow\">•</strong> &nbsp;2026-11-04 09:55:46 +08:00</span>\n    </div><div id=\"r_18250444\" class=\"cell\">\n        \n        <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n            <tr>\n                <td width=\"48\" valign=\"top\" align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/d1de2846679e39dcd5a05c49fc5eb2f2?s=48&amp;d=retro\" class=\"avatar\" border=\"0\" align=\"default\" alt=\"Rliey\" data-uid=\"613404\"></td>\n                <td width=\"10\" valign=\"top\"></td>\n                <td width=\"auto\" valign=\"top\" align=\"left\">\n                    <div class=\"flex-one-row\">\n                    <div class=\"flex-one-row gap10\"><strong><a href=\"/member/Rliey\" class=\"dark\">Rliey</a></strong><div class=\"badges\"></div><span class=\"ago\" title=\"2026-11-03 11:23:00 +08:00\">23 小时 26 分钟前</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"flex-one-row gap10\"><span class=\"no\">1</span></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"sep5\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"reply_content\">o/要合并额度池了，被逼的只能下个月准备升级 pro 了，现在双持 gpt plus 和 cursor 的 60 旧套餐，grok 终究还是差点东西，a/还一直封号 真是难受</div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div></div></div></div>",
